Also in resources/atlas/, not an atlas volume
--------------------------------------------
FreeSurferColorLUT.txt and ThalamicNuclei_LUT.txt are colour lookup tables
(id -> name -> colour) taken from FreeSurfer's distribution/ directory, used to
name the labels of a user's own FreeSurfer or FastSurfer outputs. FreeSurfer is
Copyright (C) The General Hospital Corporation (Boston, MA); the tables are
redistributed under the FreeSurfer Software License
(https://surfer.nmr.mgh.harvard.edu/fswiki/FreeSurferSoftwareLicense). No
FreeSurfer binary, atlas volume or subject data is redistributed.


